WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:01.210
Can you believe she said we were
destructive?

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:01.543
No!

00:00:01.585 --> 00:00:02.336
(Glass shatters)

00:00:02.336 --> 00:00:03.921
We're exactly the opposite!

00:00:03.921 --> 00:00:04.588
We are CONstructive.

00:00:04.588 --> 00:00:05.505
We're constructive!

00:00:05.631 --> 00:00:08.091
♪♪

00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:10.135
Charlie:
Okay.

00:00:10.135 --> 00:00:12.095
Family movie night guys!

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:12.888
Sylvia:
Oh whoa.

00:00:13.222 --> 00:00:13.764
What?

00:00:13.764 --> 00:00:14.932
Will's getting a divorce.

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:15.891
So call him.

00:00:15.891 --> 00:00:17.893
We literally haven't spoken to
each other in years.

00:00:17.893 --> 00:00:19.603
Call him. That's what friends
do.

00:00:19.603 --> 00:00:21.230
♪♪

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:22.064
Will:
Hey!

00:00:22.064 --> 00:00:23.065
Sylvia:
How are you?

00:00:23.065 --> 00:00:24.441
Great, how are you?

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:25.859
Sylvia:
How's the beer business?

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:28.362
Will:
I'm actually the brew master at
my own bar now.

00:00:28.362 --> 00:00:29.488
Congratulations!

00:00:29.488 --> 00:00:31.323
You still got that, uh, family
of yours?

00:00:31.323 --> 00:00:32.074
You wanna see a photo?

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:35.869
Wow there they are. Cool.

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:37.788
♪♪

00:00:37.788 --> 00:00:38.789
(Phone chimes)

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:39.831
What are you up to?

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.541
Oh! Why is this my life?!

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:42.459
So... lunch?

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:43.043
[Sylvia}
No.

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:43.627
Brunch?

00:00:43.627 --> 00:00:45.254
No. I don't have time for this.

00:00:45.254 --> 00:00:46.255
You can't be friends with a
girl.

00:00:46.255 --> 00:00:48.840
There's lots of famous men and
women friends.

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:51.885
Laura Dern and Sam Neil in
Jurassic Park.

00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:57.182
Your friendship with Will is not
built for this phase of life.

00:00:57.266 --> 00:00:58.016
(Glass bottles shatter)

00:00:58.016 --> 00:00:58.892
Oh geez!

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:01.561
This is how a woman experiences
a midlife crisis.

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:03.021
Audrey:
You're like a couple of teenaged
girls.

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:05.732
Your whole thing is so weird and
destructive.

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:07.651
(Garage collapses)

00:01:07.651 --> 00:01:08.652
Can you believe she said we were
destructive?

00:01:08.819 --> 00:01:11.363
No! We are exactly the opposite.

00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:13.031
-We are CONstructive.
-We're constructive.

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:14.574
♪♪

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:17.244
I don't like feeling like the
second most important man in
your life.

00:01:17.244 --> 00:01:19.371
-Dorito-saurus.
-Dorito-saurus.

00:01:19.371 --> 00:01:21.415
It's embarrassing being a mess
in front of you.

00:01:21.415 --> 00:01:23.125
Sylvia:
And Will's a much bigger mess
than I am.

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:25.419
♪♪

00:01:25.419 --> 00:01:27.421
All I want is for you to end up
happy you idiot!

00:01:27.421 --> 00:01:29.715
Well I am happy. I've never been
happier in my life!

00:01:29.715 --> 00:01:30.549
(Glass shatters)

00:01:32.801 --> 00:01:34.136
Send me the invoice.

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:37.806
♪♪

00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:40.392
Will:
Break out of your box. Do a
little nose candy with us.

00:01:40.809 --> 00:01:42.477
Did they have CK back in the
day?

00:01:42.477 --> 00:01:44.271
Andy:
It's like a mild horse
tranquilizer.

00:01:44.271 --> 00:01:45.731
It's a horse tranquilizer?!

00:01:45.731 --> 00:01:46.606
-Will Andy &amp; Reggie:
Shhh!
-Sylvia: What?!

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:48.900
You can't blow it out! It's
already in the brain!

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:51.695
♪♪

00:01:51.695 --> 00:01:54.823
In my defense, I thought it was
cocaine.

00:01:55.866 --> 00:01:58.327
And just so I'm clear- that's
your defense?

00:01:59.202 --> 00:02:00.704
The defense rests.

